      "side": 1,
      "message": "No, there should be no need to include these.\nThe client api should be entirely covered by include/drivers/cros_cbi.h\n\nThe separation here is to allow each CBI function (SSFC, FW_CONFIG) to have some cleaner separation to avoid too much intermingling (because there are so many macros).\nThere is some more opportunity to disentangle the dependencies a little more, but I didn\u0027t want to mess too much with the SSFC stuff (which I confess I\u0027m still trying to work out completely).",
      "parentUuid": "b4463f97_ccf69fd7",
      "revId": "cf89980987792622595bf6c57a78b54f5c9a3325",
